This is for the backend (Yeah thats what the name say lol )

/backend
  ├── .env                    # 🔒 Security: API Keys (Supabase, OpenAI, Azure)
  ├── requirements.txt        # 📦 List of tools (fastapi, uvicorn, supabase)
  │
  ├── /app
  │   ├── main.py             # 🚦 The Entry Point (Initializes the App)
  │   │
  │   ├── /models             # 📝 Data "Shapes" (Pydantic Schemas)
  │   │   ├── session.py      # Defines what a "Therapy Session" looks like
  │   │   └── patient.py      # Defines what a "Patient" looks like
  │   │
  │   ├── /routers            # 🛣️ The Endpoints (Separating logic by topic)
  │   │   ├── auth.py         # Login/Logout logic
  │   │   ├── robot.py        # 🤖 Robot Commands (Speak, Listen, Move)
  │   │   └── therapy.py      # 🏥 Session Logic (Start, Stop, Progress)
  │   │
  │   └── /services           # 🧠 The Logic / Brains
  │       ├── audio.py        # Whisper AI logic (Speech-to-Text)
  │       └── database.py     # Supabase connection logic